t=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bba47d15e357cf58\" href=\"?note=bba47d15e357cf58\" title=\"43-df-pi11random\">43-df-pi11random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地推导：任意固定有限 n 的有效随机测试失败类是算术零类，算术类包含于 lightface Π11；故 Π11 随机点均避开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi11random","status":"resolved","id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt